        <a href="https://github.com/zenithblue-dev/samba-s3/releases" class="rounded-2xl border border-white/20 px-6 py-3 font-bold transition hover:border-pulse hover:text-pulse">Releases</a>
        <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.zenithblue.sambas3" class="rounded-2xl border border-white/20 px-6 py-3 font-bold transition hover:border-pulse hover:text-pulse">Play Store</a>
      </div>
      <a href="https://zenithblue-dev.github.io/samba-s3" class="mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-pulse hover:text-focus">Visit the Samba S3 site →</a>
